      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent start, but looking at the sentiment score, it's a bit low for what I was hoping for. I want it to feel more \"moving\" to the donors. \n\nCan you try a second version? I need it to have more emotional weight. Try to pick up the sentiment score a bit more so it really hits that \"hopeful/impactful\" range, but again—please don't cross the line into being whiny or fake. I don't want a wall of adjectives, just a version that feels more emotionally resonant and positive about the potential for change.",
